[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 6781.27, "timestamp": "01:53:01", "text": "伏见就在外面"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6785.43, "timestamp": "01:53:05", "text": "地铁站的。所以你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6787.43, "timestamp": "01:53:07", "text": "走吧，你只需要走5到10分钟。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6789.43, "timestamp": "01:53:09", "text": "然后你就到达伏见水成站了。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6790.79, "timestamp": "01:53:10", "text": "总是建议人们进去"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6791.99, "timestamp": "01:53:11", "text": "早上起来感觉真好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6793.669, "timestamp": "01:53:13", "text": "步行。所以，如果你打算去的话"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 6794.468, "timestamp": "01:53:14", "author": "@BreaDGuy0078", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/O8v1G-sabQKoVvPbSD8h_pLVydQ_mLyNSXpDD2A2gNJXBLHO228IzT5zq41iTuqUdmG_2xiIlg=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "Wat would u recommend us if we do goo to japan"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6796.229, "timestamp": "01:53:16", "text": "在那里，一定要去做，因为那样就太好了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6797.83, "timestamp": "01:53:17", "text": "那边很便宜。它们就像灰尘一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6799.75, "timestamp": "01:53:19", "text": "便宜的。直接去那里，然后你就可以走了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6801.51, "timestamp": "01:53:21", "text": "前往大阪，然后在大阪市内游览。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6803.27, "timestamp": "01:53:23", "text": "因为我看到人们正在做的是"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 6805.696, "timestamp": "01:53:25", "author": "@BreaDGuy0078", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/O8v1G-sabQKoVvPbSD8h_pLVydQ_mLyNSXpDD2A2gNJXBLHO228IzT5zq41iTuqUdmG_2xiIlg=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "like ur most recommended thing can be anything"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6805.99, "timestamp": "01:53:25", "text": "就像他们为了京都而留在京都一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6807.91, "timestamp": "01:53:27", "text": "然后他们花更多的钱，然后他们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6809.91, "timestamp": "01:53:29", "text": "去大阪消费更多。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6811.99, "timestamp": "01:53:31", "text": "所以，与其那样，不如直接去一处。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6813.43, "timestamp": "01:53:33", "text": "然后从那里出发前往目的地"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6819.99, "timestamp": "01:53:39", "text": "那是我想去的地方。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6821.35, "timestamp": "01:53:41", "text": "我不了解海洋那方面的事情，因为我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6823.27, "timestamp": "01:53:43", "text": "害怕我所害怕的事物"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 6825.012, "timestamp": "01:53:45", "author": "@Orange-Sleipnir", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_n5J-87avtPs7B_snpcnK5WQMhN-5kM_m8EJRYz2oJ72Wg=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "that's what I like from Japan too. There seems to be tons of family run places that are generations old"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6826.229, "timestamp": "01:53:46", "text": "游泳。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6828.55, "timestamp": "01:53:48", "text": "我不会正确地游泳。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6831.27, "timestamp": "01:53:51", "text": "相同的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6834.629, "timestamp": "01:53:54", "text": "所以这变成了什么样子？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6838.55, "timestamp": "01:53:58", "text": "就像游客的想法一样。"}]